================================================================================
THIRD-PARTY COMPONENTS
================================================================================

Three licence surfaces feed this file, and each has a CI gate behind it:

  engines.toml   native engines shipped as libraries, with their LINK MODE
  models.toml    model weights, with their format and hash
  deny.toml      the Rust dependency tree, allow-listed by licence

CI fails if a component is referenced in code without a row in the table that
owns it. This file is the human-readable rendering of those three tables; the
tables are the source of truth.

