allow-list is Apache-2.0, Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception, MIT, BSD-2-Clause,
BSD-3-Clause, ISC, Zlib, Unicode-3.0, CC0-1.0 and MPL-2.0. A complete
dependency-level SBOM in CycloneDX form is published with each release; the
direct dependencies that do the conversion work are:

