--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
WEBSITE
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

openconvert.dev is built with Astro (MIT) and ships no third-party runtime code:
zero JavaScript on content pages, no remote fonts, no analytics, and a
Content-Security-Policy with connect-src 'none'. A build gate fails the site on
any external request.


